        // WAL - Generic, payload-agnostic Write-Ahead Log with AES-256-GCM encryption
        // 2026-11-15: v0.1.24 (acd8f68, SONNY-6622) — recovery and compaction
        // fail closed (WalEncryptionMismatch / WalAuthFailed / WalCorrupted)
        // on data they cannot read; only a genuine torn tail is truncated on
        // open.
        // 2026-11-15: v0.1.25 (eca478c, SONNY-6628, SONNY-738) — truncateAfter fails
