            // for a wrong key, WalCorrupted for mid-log damage; salvage is
            // opt-in). A torn tail is still truncated, from the first bad
            // record only. geode's thread_pool override in build.zig wins.
            // 2026-11-15: v0.2.22 (e44380b, SONNY-6623) — Engine.deinit
            // closes the WAL directory Engine.init opened (and init's
            // errdefer does); the WAL refusals are returned as
